## Scenarios

### Reed-Solomon GF bounds guards

#### rejects out-of-range multiplication operands

- Verify: rejects out-of-range multiplication operands


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: rejects out-of-range multiplication operands")
assert_equal(gf_mul(-1, 1), 0)
assert_equal(gf_mul(1, 256), 0)
```

</details>

#### rejects out-of-range inverse operands

- Verify: rejects out-of-range inverse operands


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: rejects out-of-range inverse operands")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
assert_equal(gf_inv(-1), 0)
assert_equal(gf_inv(256), 0)
```

</details>

#### rejects out-of-range powers

- Verify: rejects out-of-range powers


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: rejects out-of-range powers")
assert_equal(gf_pow(-1, 2), 0)
assert_equal(gf_pow(2, -1), 0)
```

</details>

#### keeps valid GF arithmetic

- Verify: keeps valid GF arithmetic


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: keeps valid GF arithmetic")
assert_equal(gf_mul(2, 2), 4)
assert_equal(gf_inv(1), 1)
assert_equal(gf_pow(2, 0), 1)
```

</details>

